# What K816 compiles this fixture to, assembled with ca65 and linked with
# `../../atarixl.cfg`.  Sixteen bytes per line, load address in the left
# column; the zero fill past the last byte is trimmed.
#
# `oracle.hex` beside this is the original's answer to the same source.  The
# suite does not compare the two - it compares this against K816 - but the
# five bytes the two questions decide, `01 42` and `A9 03`, are identical,
# and that agreement is the claim `fixture.txt` makes.

origin 2000
